{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c36893d7-8f9a-8acf-abb5-ae6ac2132e46",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:36:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water and Sewer billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Colin Flynn. I got a water bill that's wrong, and I'd like it fixed. I'm standing at a gas station next to the pump, so if you hear a clunk, that's the nozzle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, Mr. Flynn. What seems to be wrong with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the wrong amount. I've got two properties, and this one is the house on the account ending in forty-two. No, wait. Forty-two is the rental. The house is the other one. Hold on, I've got the papers in the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Could you read me the service address on the bill you have in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The bill I have says the rental, and they've charged me for the house usage. That's what I'm telling you. Somebody swapped them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I see both accounts under your name. The rental's reading does look like the higher one, so it may well have been posted to the wrong account. I can request a corrected bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And mail it, please. Don't email, I don't do email. Also, I need a breakdown of usage month by month. I'm trying to put a budget together and I'm not guessing anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. I'll include the monthly usage for the past year for both accounts with the corrected bill. It should go out in the mail this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week. Fine. And the amount I owe on the house is a hundred sixty-seven thirty-five, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one hundred sixty-seven dollars and thirty-five cents on the house account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll pay it now, over the phone, with the card. Ready? Four zero one two, eight eight eight eight, eight eight eight eight, one eight eight one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Four zero one two, eight eight eight eight, eight eight eight eight, one eight eight one. What's the expiration date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh five, thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, zero five, thirty. I've applied one hundred sixty-seven thirty-five to the house account. The corrected bill and the usage breakdown will come by mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Next time get it right the first time. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, Mr. Flynn. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
